	j > i / C_# after the loss of a final vowel or syllable
	ij > i:[+long] / _s after the loss of a vowel in final syllables
	ij > i / _# after the loss of a final vowel or syllable
	Vw > u / _s (to wit, the vowel is deleted and the *w syllabifies)
	iji > i:[+long] / :[-stress](C…)_
	iji > i:[+long] / :[+ long
	i > ∅ / _ji
	m > β / C:[-voice]_n, when medial
	m > ɸ / C:[+voice]_n, when medial
	n:[+long] > n / _C // _j
